{"page":251,"width":1848,"height":2264,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"12.1 소개","words":[{"text":"12.1","x":247,"y":190,"width":81,"height":38},{"text":"소개","x":354,"y":189,"width":84,"height":39}]},{"text":"리스트나 벡터 등의 자료 구조는 그 자체만으로는 크게 유용하지 않다. 자료 구조를","words":[{"text":"리스트나","x":246,"y":275,"width":132,"height":34},{"text":"벡터","x":393,"y":276,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"등의","x":472,"y":276,"width":63,"height":33},{"text":"자료","x":553,"y":276,"width":65,"height":33},{"text":"구조는","x":632,"y":277,"width":99,"height":31},{"text":"그","x":744,"y":280,"width":33,"height":22},{"text":"자체만으로는","x":792,"y":274,"width":197,"height":34},{"text":"크게","x":1003,"y":273,"width":64,"height":33},{"text":"유용하지","x":1084,"y":273,"width":133,"height":32},{"text":"않다.","x":1238,"y":272,"width":78,"height":33},{"text":"자료","x":1337,"y":272,"width":73,"height":32},{"text":"구조를","x":1427,"y":272,"width":118,"height":32}]},{"text":"잘 사용하려면 (tist와 vector에서 제공하듯이) 요소를 추가하고 제거하는 등의 기본적","words":[{"text":"잘","x":243,"y":341,"width":35,"height":31},{"text":"사용하려면","x":291,"y":341,"width":164,"height":33},{"text":"(tist와","x":470,"y":344,"width":103,"height":28},{"text":"vector에서","x":584,"y":343,"width":146,"height":29},{"text":"제공하듯이)","x":748,"y":342,"width":155,"height":30},{"text":"요소를","x":919,"y":340,"width":99,"height":31},{"text":"추가하고","x":1032,"y":338,"width":134,"height":33},{"text":"제거하는","x":1182,"y":337,"width":140,"height":33},{"text":"등의","x":1337,"y":337,"width":70,"height":32},{"text":"기본적","x":1429,"y":335,"width":111,"height":34}]},{"text":"인 접근을 할 수 있는 연산이 필요하다. 게다가 컨테이너에 요소를 저장하기만하는","words":[{"text":"인","x":245,"y":405,"width":29,"height":31},{"text":"접근을","x":294,"y":405,"width":98,"height":32},{"text":"할","x":408,"y":406,"width":33,"height":31},{"text":"수","x":456,"y":405,"width":33,"height":32},{"text":"있는","x":506,"y":404,"width":64,"height":32},{"text":"연산이","x":586,"y":405,"width":93,"height":31},{"text":"필요하다.","x":700,"y":405,"width":137,"height":32},{"te